---
import '../styles/global.css';
const repo = 'https://github.com/qmqsu/folio';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="页间 Folio：给小纸 Pico（RDP-G01-W）做的阅读固件。TXT 和 EPUB 原生排版，一键刷入，手机传书。" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://qmqsu.github.io https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/folio/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://qmqsu.github.io/folio/" />
  <title>页间 Folio · 小纸 Pico 阅读固件</title>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
  <header class="site-header wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="#main" aria-label="页间 Folio 首页"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 6h9l2 3 2-3h9v21H18l-2 2-2-2H5V6Zm11 3v20M9 11h3m-3 5h3m8-5h3m-3 5h3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /></svg><span>页间 <b>Folio</b></span></a>
    <nav aria-label="主导航">
      <a href="#interfaces">界面</a>
      <a href="#features">功能</a>
      <a href="#flash">刷机</a>
      <a class="source-link" href={repo}>源码 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#flash">一键刷机 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="mono hero-kicker">RDP-G01-W · 4.7″ 墨水屏 · 原生排版</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">把书，<br />放回纸上<span class="period">。</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">轻量化阅读固件，统一的界面设计，简洁直观的交互，原生集成微信阅读。</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#flash">一键刷机 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#interfaces">看看界面 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note mono">应用 MIT 开源 · 不联网也能读</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-shot">
        <img src="/folio/images/home.webp" alt="Folio 首页：继续阅读、阅读时长和最近阅读。" />
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="flash wrap" id="flash" aria-labelledby="flash-title">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="mono">01 / 刷机</span><span class="mono en">FLASH</span></div>
      <div class="flash-head">
        <h2 id="flash-title">插上线，点一下。</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">桌面版 Chrome 或 Edge，一根能传数据的线。写完逐段回读，NVS 和卡里的书都不动。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flash-bar">
        <div class="flash-action">
          <button id="flash-button" class="button primary" type="button" disabled>一键刷入 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <div class="flash-readout">
            <p class="mono" id="flash-version">正在查最新固件…</p>
            <p id="flash-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在准备。</p>
            <progress id="flash-progress" max="100" value="0" hidden></progress>
            <a id="flash-save" class="flash-save" hidden download>保存备份</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <label class="flash-backup" for="flash-backup">
          <input id="flash-backup" type="checkbox" checked />
          <span>先自动备份 16 MiB</span>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="flash-parts mono">写入四段 · bootloader 0x000000 · partition-table 0x008000 · app 0x010000 · ota-data 0x910000</p>
      <p class="flash-alt">仅接受已有 Folio 布局；会重置 OTA 选择到 factory，不写 NVS、字体资源或备用 OTA 槽。</p>
      <p class="flash-alt">不想用网页？<a href={`${repo}/releases`}>下载镜像 ↗</a>　<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/刷机说明.md`}>手动刷写说明 ↗</a>　TF 卡更新包放进 <code>update/</code></p>
    </section>

    <section class="interfaces wrap" id="interfaces" aria-labelledby="interfaces-title">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="mono">02 / 界面</span><span class="mono en">SCREENS</span></div>
      <h2 id="interfaces-title">屏幕上只有字。</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">书架、阅读、设置，三屏就够。界面是固件渲染的，书是示例。</p>
      <div class="interface-grid">
        <figure><img src="/folio/images/library.webp" alt="书架：封面、书名、阅读位置。" /><figcaption>书架</figcaption></figure>
        <figure><img src="/folio/images/reading.webp" alt="阅读：正文、章节、页码。" /><figcaption>阅读</figcaption></figure>
        <figure><img src="/folio/images/settings.webp" alt="设置：阅读、个性化、传书与系统。" /><figcaption>设置</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features wrap" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="mono">03 / 功能</span><span class="mono en">FEATURES</span></div>
      <h2 id="features-title">书页之外的几件事。</h2>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>书放在卡里</h3>
          <p>TF 卡的 <code>books</code> 目录，TXT 和 EPUB 都认。有目录、书签，开机接着上次读。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>字随你调</h3>
          <p>字号、行距、页边距、对齐都能改。内置宋体，另外三款字体放进卡里就能选。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>手机传书</h3>
          <p>同一个 Wi-Fi 打开传书页，书、图片、字体都能传。退出传书页，服务就关。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>关机也是一页</h3>
          <p>锁屏和关机壁纸自己选，32 MiB 内的大图也放得下。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>读到哪，记到哪</h3>
          <p>继续阅读、最近在读、每天读多久，都留在卡上。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>微信读书 <span class="tag">实验</span></h3>
          <p>设备上登录、看书架、下载后离线读。走的是非公开协议，上游一改就可能失效。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="mono">04 / 关于</span><span class="mono en">ABOUT</span></div>
      <h2 id="about-title">源码在 GitHub。</h2>
      <p class="about-text">应用以 MIT 开源。板级支持、EPDiy、字体和第三方组件各按自己的许可。微信读书的协议适配参考了 wxBook 和 CrossMux。</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="text-link" href={repo}>源码 ↗</a>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSES.md`}>第三方许可 ↗</a>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${repo}/issues`}>反馈 ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="#main">页间 <b>Folio</b></a>
    <p>给小纸 Pico 做的阅读固件。</p>
    <a href="#main">回到顶部 ↑</a>
  </footer>
  <script>import '../installer/quick-ui';</script>
</body>
</html>
